# Cloudflare Pages rewrites .html requests to the extension-less path with a
# 308 by default. DMCA's ownership checker fetches this exact URL, so proxy it
# to the same asset with a 200 response instead.
/dmca-validation.html /dmca-validation 200

# The old Security & Compliance pages (/security, /security/compliance,
# /security/responsibility) were retired in the Bộ Công Thương policy
# restructure. Their copy made broader claims than the current Privacy Policy
# (data always domestic, full standards compliance, Marketplace as the
# highest-assurance model). Redirect the URLs to the current, precisely-scoped
# Privacy Policy — which limits commitments to the resources Vieomics directly
# operates and makes residency conditional on configuration — so no stale,
# overbroad claims stay reachable. Redirects run before static assets on
# Cloudflare Pages, so they also retire any leftover copies from an older build.
/security /privacy 301
/security/ /privacy 301
/security/* /privacy 301
/en/security /en/privacy 301
/en/security/ /en/privacy 301
/en/security/* /en/privacy 301
